{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fcharset0 Segoe UI;}{\f1\fmodern\fcharset0 Consolas;}}{\colortbl;\red15\green118\blue110;\red24\green24\blue27;\red180\green83\blue9;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\b\f0\fs24 PocketGull Typeface Superfamily (v3.1.0)\par\cf2\b0\fs18 Sans, Serif, Slab, Monospace, and Technical Fonts\par\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1\cf2\fs18\parDesigned by \b Phil Gear\b0  (\i The PocketGull Project Authors\i0 ). PocketGull is an open-source typeface family engineered for clinical interfaces, scientific publishing, and high-legibility technical documentation, with explicit character disambiguation (\b 0/O\b0 , \b 1/l/I\b0 , \b Z/2\b0 , \b b/d\b0 , \b p/q\b0 ).\par\cf1\b Included in this package (32 TrueType fonts):\b0\cf2\par\f1\fs16  - PocketGull Sans (Regular, Italic, Bold, BoldItalic, Black, Condensed)\par - PocketGull Display (Fineliner, Chiseltip, MarkerRaw, Halftone, Inline, Outline, Micro)\par - PocketGull Serif, Slab & Soft (Regular, Bold, Variable Fonts)\par - PocketGull Mono (Regular, Italic, Bold Fixed-Width Monospace)\par - PocketGull Technical & Accessibility (Math, Chem, Lab, Genome, Algo, Music, Numerics, Learn, Sign, ASL)\par\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs18\par\cf3\b License:\b0\cf2  SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1) \emdash  Free for commercial, clinical, academic, and personal use.\par}